{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42542","headline":"劝王氏入贡宠予以官作辞命篇 · 詹敦仁","name":"劝王氏入贡宠予以官作辞命篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"争霸图王事总非，中原失统可伤悲。\n从来宾主如邮传，胜负干戈似局棊。\n周粟纵荣宁忍食，葛庐频顾谩劳思。\n江山有待早归去，好向鹪林择一枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹敦仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}